    "name": "Sound of Survival",
    "steam_appid": 3464830,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and survive to the beat against various robots that want to bring you down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve yourself each round to face the boss in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sound of Survival is a rhythm shooter with Vampire Survivors elements, offering multiple unlockable levels and difficulty modes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/d5abe9aeac6e95700230c90137f316af.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/92c28539b57a57717304845dbc2a4b25.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against the onslaught of machines in each round. Shoot in sync with the music using the different modes of your weapon to optimally take down various enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round, you can individually upgrade yourself and your weapon in the shop menu to perform better next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a suitable song and begin the upcoming round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/5d50889970e6578bfa354363fae7aa4a.poster.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/5d50889970e6578bfa354363fae7aa4a.webm?t=1749317176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot on the beat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, jump, and dash perfect to the beat to increase your damage, leaving your enemies with no chance. You can choose from a variety of songs composed specifically for this game. Each song has a unique speed and duration, helping you find the track that best fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/3f4b7b1b0c92c852d302b860652ab9c7.poster.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/3f4b7b1b0c92c852d302b860652ab9c7.webm?t=1749317176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaprogression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each playthrough, you have the opportunity to further upgrade yourself, your weapon, or the shop to perform even better in the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to unlock additional levels or difficulty modes and prove that you have the best sense of rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/6febb68608d1f52b9fc8031d9a7ffd40.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/9387ed38c128727ff24c0657d4a32d9d.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight and survive to the beat against various robots that want to bring you down. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve yourself each round to face the boss in the final showdown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sound of Survival is a rhythm shooter with Vampire Survivors elements, offering multiple unlockable levels and difficulty modes.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/d5abe9aeac6e95700230c90137f316af.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/92c28539b57a57717304845dbc2a4b25.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=91 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against the onslaught of machines in each round. Shoot in sync with the music using the different modes of your weapon to optimally take down various enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round, you can individually upgrade yourself and your weapon in the shop menu to perform better next round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose a suitable song and begin the upcoming round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/5d50889970e6578bfa354363fae7aa4a.poster.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/5d50889970e6578bfa354363fae7aa4a.webm?t=1749317176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shoot on the beat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot, jump, and dash perfect to the beat to increase your damage, leaving your enemies with no chance. You can choose from a variety of songs composed specifically for this game. Each song has a unique speed and duration, helping you find the track that best fits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/3f4b7b1b0c92c852d302b860652ab9c7.poster.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/3f4b7b1b0c92c852d302b860652ab9c7.webm?t=1749317176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Metaprogression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each playthrough, you have the opportunity to further upgrade yourself, your weapon, or the shop to perform even better in the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the boss to unlock additional levels or difficulty modes and prove that you have the best sense of rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/6febb68608d1f52b9fc8031d9a7ffd40.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3464830/extras/9387ed38c128727ff24c0657d4a32d9d.avif?t=1749317176\" width=616 height=105 /></span></p>",
